<title>USA: Horizon Group names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Horizon Group names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTON SHORES, Mich. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon Group Inc said Monday it namned James Wassel, 46, president and successor to Chief Executive Officer Ron Piasecki, effective May 12.</p>
<p>Initially, Wassel will assume the responsibilities of chief operating officer, it added.  </p>
<p>Horizon owns, operates and develops outlet centers.</p>
<p>Wassel had been senior vice president - asset management with Crescent Real Estate Equities Inc, Horizon said.</p>
<p>Piasecki, who will continue as interim chief executive officer, was elected vice chairman of the board.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
